1168 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PERSONAL PROFILE\050Computer Systems Engineer \050Ing\351nieure en syst\350mes informatiques\054 ISI\051 with hands\055on experience in enterprise\nIT infrastructure\054 AI\055assisted identity \046 access management\054 and cybersecurity\054 built through an engineering thesis\nconducted with Sonatrach\054 academic projects\054 and freelance development work\056 Strong interest in artificial\nintelligence\054 cybersecurity\054 and Identity \046 Access Management \050IAM\051\056 Actively seeking a professional position to\napply this expertise in a real\055world environment\056\n\nEDUCATION\nEngineering Degree \046 Master in Computer Systems Engineering \050ISI\051\n\311cole Sup\351rieure en Informatique \050ESI\023SBA\051\054Sidi Bel Abb\350s\054 Algeria \042 Sept\056 2021 \023 July 2026 \n\042 Key focus areas\072 Computer Systems\054 Artificial Intelligence\054 Distributed Systems\054 Networks\054 Cybersecurity\n\042 Engineering thesis \050PFE\051\072 AegisAIMail \024 a policy\055driven\054 AI\055assisted Identity \046 Access Management orchestrator\054\ndeveloped with Sonatrach\n\042 Master\047s thesis\072 Zero Trust security analysis of AegisAIMail \050STRIDE threat modeling\073 semi\055quantitative scoring\ninspired by DREAD\057OWASP\051 \024 both defended July 8\054 2026\nBaccalaur\351at \023 Scientific Stream\nLyc\351e de Relizane\054 Algeria \023 June 2021 \nOverall Average\072 16\05697\05720 \174 Weighted Average\072 17\05683\05720\n\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nEngineering Thesis Intern \024 Sonatrach\nFebruary 2026\n\042Designed and built AegisAIMail\054 a policy\055driven\054 AI\055assisted IAM orchestrator \050Python\054 FastAPI\054 NLP\054\nActive Directory\054 Exchange\054 systemd\054Hyper\055V\051 \nComputer Systems Intern\137Soci\351t\351 Nationale d\031Assurance \050SAA\051\054 Relizane\054 Algeria\nSeptember 2024 \023 October 2024\n\042 Gained exposure to enterprise IT systems\054 networks\054 and Active Directory\n\042 Analyzed and simulated enterprise network architecture\n\042 Took part in IT support and incident\055handling activities\nFreelance Full\055Stack Web Developer \050Confidential Project\051\nSummer 2025  \042 Public demo\072 kadi\055inv\056store\n\042 Designed intuitive UI\057UX and user journeys for a custom web platform\054 focusing on usability and user experience\n\042 Developed frontend using React\054 JSX\054 and Tailwind CSS\n\042 Implemented REST APIs with Django REST Framework and PostgreSQL\n\042 Collaborated directly with an entrepreneur under strict confidentiality\nFreelance Mobile Developer \023 KWITELY \050Label Projet Innovant\051\nSummer 2025  \042 Label Projet Innovant\n\042 Contributed to a mobile application certified by the National Startup Committee\n\042 UI\057UX design\054 system flow analysis\054 and frontend development using Flutter\n\042 Collaborated within a startup\055oriented development team\n\nACADEMIC \046 TECHNICAL PROJECTS\nIntrusion Detection System \050IDS\051 for Network Attacks Classification\n\042 Designed an IDS capable of detecting and classifying 21 network attack types\n\042 Simulated attack scenarios and applied machine learning techniques\nHajj Pilgrimage Management Platform\n\042 Developed a complete information system for registration\054 lottery\054 medical visits\054 and reservations\nMobile E\055Commerce Application for Books\n\042 Designed a mobile app for buying\054 selling\054 donating\054 and exchanging books\nProduct Management Software \023 Java \050NetBeans\051\n\042 Developed a desktop application with CRUD operations and object\055oriented design\n\n)
